  "notes": "Issue #517. EXP-374 model, folds, seed, checkpoint policy, stop notation parser, pathways, hotspots and Ensembl residue-position mask are all fixed and unchanged. The sole change is additive: two new sample-level derived burden columns computed from the fixed 15-gene long-gene passenger candidate list (knowledge/long_gene_passenger_candidates_v1.json), on top of the unchanged existing sample__mutated_gene_count total burden feature. No existing GENE__mutated-style column is removed, replaced or reweighted. This is deliberately additive-only because 5 prior column-removal/pruning experiments in this repository (EXP-188/189/190 Phi-Jaccard pruning, EXP-192 rare-column removal, EXP-355/359/496 complex-count representation changes) were all REJECTED for fold-std or Log Loss regression. Target, test distribution and Public LB do not define the gene list or formulas.",
